        {
          "text": "Pele wakamwaambila kuti, Ulaamba mbuli mufubafuba. Sena tatweelede kutambula bubotu kujanza lya-Leza abubi? Kuli zeezi zyoonse Jobu takwaakabija amilomo yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
