                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazuba amasiku aakali musanu mwaabili bakakala ansi anguwe; katakwe wakaamba jwi kulinguwe, nkaambo bakabona kuti wakali kuciswa kapati mumoyo.",
